"The Nautilus Needle is the tallest skyscraper on Anesidora, crowning an F City district."
"It has a silver spire and famously visible helix shields of Wrightmade shielding with a gleam."
"Its elevator doors are etched with nautilus shells that light with gold and silver specks."
"The elevators have mirrored ceilings, and the tower holds a conference hall."
"The Verne, at its top, has porthole windows and a floor dappled with light as if underwater."
"The Verne's events are booked a year ahead, and magic cleans up its spills."
"A karaage restaurant at its base hires a Sky Shaper to vent its smell onto the sidewalk."
"Manon Barre lived in an apartment near the Needle."
